v1.2.0
For the GOcontroll Suite (a web page), beside the upload, which is unchanged:
GET /info: the controller and the application it holds
POST /application/start and /application/stop: the go-simulink service
GET /xcp: a WebSocket to the XCP server of the application (XCP on TCP)
CORS headers for the pages of the Suite, also on POST /upload

